# the relocations of the Arm 64-bit ELF ABI, LP64
#
# one row for every relocation the vendored definition file lists, applied as
# RELA records. generated by vendor/llvm/gen-elf-aarch64.py. the instruction
# fields are bit ranges of a 32-bit little endian word, the checked move-wide
# forms hold their sign in the opcode, scaled low-12 forms check the alignment
# of the access, and the dynamic and marker codes hold no static field. a
# relaxation names the kind of the form it rewrites to.

